    "text": "newportdispatch.com\nwebsite\nBroadalbin\nPerth fire companies respond to structure fire on State Highway 30\nBy Daniel Duric,\n4 hours agoPERTH — The Broadalbin-Kennyetto Fire Company and Perth Volunteer Fire Company responded to a structure fire on State Highway 30 on Wednesday at 2:04 p.m. Both fire companies were dispatched under automatic mutual aid protocols. Lake Valley EMS was also called to the scene. Perth Volunteer Fire Company received...",
